{"id":"a9884e5fce6eac84","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-generic-hierarchy.md","title":"泛型性与弱泛型性的层次","display":"thm-generic-hierarchy — 泛型性与弱泛型性的层次","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-generic-hierarchy","aliases":["43-thm-generic-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-generic-hierarchy — 泛型性与弱泛型性的层次","depends_on":["[[43-df-genericity]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.15.1, observation after Definition 11.15.6; Theorem 11.15.8","source_printed_pages":"287","source_pdf_pages":"307","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-generic-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-generic-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-hierarchy — 泛型性与弱泛型性的层次"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.15.1, observation after Definition 11.15.6; Theorem 11.15.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"287"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"307"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{NGeneric}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dense}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dense}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n\">\\(\\mathcal S_n\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n+1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n+1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式中稠密性排除了Avoids分支。第二式对每个V∈S_n构造D=V∪{σ:∀τ⊒σ(τ∉V)}；D稠密且属于S_{n+1}，遇到D就决定V。草稿证明对应的S′公式已按此读回。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§11.15.1, observation after Definition 11.15.6; Theorem 11.15.8，印刷页287，PDF页307。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}$、$\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}$、$\\operatorname{Dense}$、$\\mathcal S_n$ 采用 [[43-df-genericity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NGeneric}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dense}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n+1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n).","display":true}],"bytes":1470,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-generic-hierarchy]] — 泛型性与弱泛型性的层次"}],"outgoing":["39322da73a94b6b8"]}